# Lab 5 - Gossip Membership & Heartbeat Protocol

## Usage with RPC Setup
To start open one terminal for the server and cd into the lab5/server directory

```sh
cd lab5/server
```
Next open up 8 terminals for the clients, you can split them with the Split Terminal button for vertical split and holding 'Alt' for horizontal splits. Cd into the lab5.client directory

```sh
cd lab5/client
```

First start up the server by running

```sh
go run server.go
```
Then start each client independently by running

```sh
go run client.go
```

in each terminal window. Try to do this somewhat quickly so that they all start around the same time.
